WEBVTT

00:13:29.153 --> 00:13:31.110
kadarkoli; 
nikoli niste prestari."

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:35.232
Pri 64, česar ni nihče
katerekoli starosti, spola,

00:13:35.232 --> 00:13:36.915
zmogel, sem to storila,

00:13:36.915 --> 00:13:38.679
in ni dvoma,

00:13:38.679 --> 00:13:41.648
da sem danes na vrhuncu življenja.

00:13:41.648 --> 00:13:44.476
(Aplavz)

00:13:44.476 --> 00:13:47.294
Ja.

00:13:50.058 --> 00:13:51.881
Hvala.

00:13:51.881 --> 00:13:54.035
In tretja stvar,
ki sem jo rekla na plaži:

00:13:54.035 --> 00:13:56.724
"Izgleda kot 
najbolj samoten trud na svetu

00:13:56.724 --> 00:13:58.716
in na mnoge načine seveda je

00:13:58.716 --> 00:14:02.593
in na druge, najbolj pomembne načine,